<title>USA: GRC International Q3 shr $0.06 vs $0.13 loss.</title>
<headline>GRC International Q3 shr $0.06 vs $0.13 loss.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.06     loss	 $0.13</p>
<p> Net profit		 8,794     loss	   149</p>
<p> Revs			29,311		   27,645</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,962		    9,743</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS ended March 31</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.20     loss	 $0.10</p>
<p> Net loss		  10,410     loss	 1,394</p>
<p> Revs			86,348		   85,780</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,595		    9,528</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The above net income is from continuing operations. The company reported a net income from discontinued operations for the 1997 third quarter of $516,000 versus a loss of $1.3 million.</p>
<p>The company reported earnings per share from continuing operations of $0.89 versus $0.02, and a loss from discontinued operations per share of $0.83 versus a loss of $0.15.</p>
<p>The company said it discontinued its Telecommunications and Advanced Products division during the third quarter of this fiscal year.</p>
